WEBVTT

01:43.791 --> 01:45.042
What are we gonna do with it, huh?

01:45.126 --> 01:47.503
Oh, this Sandy is mine.
Always has been.

01:47.586 --> 01:49.255
Why is this one began to chipped?

01:49.338 --> 01:52.174
Uninstalling it
is gonna cost us, so are you ready?

01:52.258 --> 01:54.051
Ugh. It'll spike us shit.

01:54.135 --> 01:56.387
He's a massive pain in my ass.

01:56.470 --> 01:58.347
How about we flat-line them?

01:58.430 --> 02:01.725
The five Fingers can have discount
on work created on his cold dead body.

02:01.809 --> 02:03.227
We still need a reaper for that.

02:03.310 --> 02:05.062
But we'd breakeven, wouldn't we?

02:05.146 --> 02:06.522
Sure, barely. I suppose.

02:06.605 --> 02:10.401
You hear that? I should just
rip the damn thing off myself.

02:10.484 --> 02:14.321
Maybe then you'd finally learn not to
clap-shit that ain't yours, piss sniffer.

02:14.905 --> 02:16.574
Please don't get blood all over my room,

02:16.657 --> 02:17.700
-all right?
-Stay out of this!

02:17.783 --> 02:20.536
Um, excuse me?
I was the one who found him.

02:20.619 --> 02:21.704
Grr.

02:23.247 --> 02:25.374
-You fucking lied to me?
-Shut up!

02:25.457 --> 02:28.752
Now, spill it. What the fuck you're doing
and parading around on my throne?

02:28.836 --> 02:30.212
Yours?

02:30.296 --> 02:32.381
You bet your ass. That's right.

02:32.464 --> 02:35.843
Bought and paid for it. Except my supplier
ghosted once I put down.

02:35.926 --> 02:37.970
So, what'd you get for paying in advance?

02:38.053 --> 02:39.972
-I can't move.
-Shut it!

02:40.055 --> 02:44.435
She's got people. One of our own.
Just looking to make some fast scratch.

02:44.518 --> 02:46.228
She'd been curved for it too. Up to now.

02:46.312 --> 02:47.229
Hold on.

02:47.313 --> 02:49.732
-Huh?
-Your supplier. You mean…

02:49.815 --> 02:53.527
Gloria Martinez. That ring a bell?

02:53.611 --> 02:55.237
Oh, yeah. She's my mom.

02:55.321 --> 02:56.447
Huh?

02:56.530 --> 02:58.407
So, you're Gloria's brat?

02:58.490 --> 03:00.367
Why did she think you can handle
an offer with you?

03:00.451 --> 03:01.869
She didn't. She died.

03:01.952 --> 03:03.412
Huh?

03:03.495 --> 03:04.455
Yesterday.

03:04.538 --> 03:08.250
What the fuck?
But I just talked to her two days ago.

03:08.334 --> 03:10.753
What happened?
The bad just killed get her, or--

03:10.836 --> 03:12.588
It was a car accident.

03:12.671 --> 03:16.258
From some kind of gang group drive-by…
Got caught in the crossfire.

03:16.342 --> 03:18.844
Nothing to do with the Sandevistan.

03:20.346 --> 03:21.555
Hmm.

03:22.348 --> 03:23.515
Hmm.

03:24.099 --> 03:26.727
Tracks why she never bought us back.

03:26.810 --> 03:29.521
Condolences, kid. That's tough, but still…

03:30.522 --> 03:33.776
Don't paid for a set
that makes things free and easy for you.

03:33.859 --> 03:36.028
Listen. I had no idea it was yours.

03:36.111 --> 03:37.738
Yeah, I've never been an escort

03:37.821 --> 03:40.282
chipping all the mails spectrum
my mom left lying around.

03:40.366 --> 03:41.951
Good times, good times.

03:42.034 --> 03:44.245
Christ! This twerp's
clearly got a screw lose!

03:44.328 --> 03:46.538
Back off. He didn't know
what he was doing.

03:47.790 --> 03:50.542
You guys… are cyberpunks, aren't you?

03:55.756 --> 03:57.174
What's it to you?

03:58.300 --> 03:59.593
Let me keep the Sandy.

03:59.677 --> 04:02.137
Can't pay you back just now,
but I'll work it off.

04:02.221 --> 04:04.807
One gig at a time, long as it takes.

04:04.890 --> 04:07.893
Not good enough.
Shit's a military-grade.

04:07.977 --> 04:10.396
You can't just buy another off the shelf.

04:10.479 --> 04:12.731
Whatever you paid my mom,
I'll get it back.

04:12.815 --> 04:14.066
No deal.

04:14.149 --> 04:15.985
I said, no murder.

04:16.068 --> 04:18.445
Come on! Just give me a chance!

04:18.529 --> 04:21.490
Now that's funny.
I look like I run a preschool to you?

04:21.573 --> 04:23.450
I'll fire up the Sandevistan.

04:23.534 --> 04:27.538
Bullshit. Totally like you can't
boot it up without keeling over.

04:27.621 --> 04:29.456
This toddler's full of surprises.

04:29.540 --> 04:30.833
-Hmm?
-Hmm? No.

04:30.916 --> 04:33.210
Body his size
would sizzle up after two hits.

04:33.294 --> 04:34.837
Tried eight. No sizzle.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.130
-Hmm?
-Hmm?

04:36.213 --> 04:38.966
Come on. That's a lot of bunk
and we all know it.

04:39.049 --> 04:42.594
Yeah? Okay. Then how about I prove it?

04:43.178 --> 04:45.597
Whoa. Plant your ass back down.

04:45.681 --> 04:48.559
Yo! Chill out.
Just gonna clap this cig real quick.

04:48.642 --> 04:50.602
That's in up my sleeve… See?

04:50.686 --> 04:51.645
Wha--? Huh?

04:53.564 --> 04:55.941
-Aah!
-That makes nine today…

04:56.025 --> 04:57.985
No way. It's actually ten.

04:58.068 --> 05:01.071
Holy shit! What in the
fast forward fuck was that?

05:01.155 --> 05:02.281
Just give me a chance.

05:02.364 --> 05:04.992
A chance, huh? What kind?

05:05.617 --> 05:07.619
Easy. You take me out on a job.

05:08.454 --> 05:09.747
Won't fuck it up.

05:21.842 --> 05:23.969
Got quite a pay on you.
I'll give you that.

05:24.053 --> 05:25.929
Okay, kid. You get one chance.

05:26.013 --> 05:27.598
Oh, great. Here we go again.

05:27.681 --> 05:31.393
I owe it to Gloria, and maybe
the apple don't fall far. Hmm?

05:31.477 --> 05:32.603
You won't regret it.

05:32.686 --> 05:34.980
-Huh? He-- Hey!
-Chill.

05:35.064 --> 05:36.565
Just slotting a tracker.

05:36.648 --> 05:39.193
Wouldn't want you go on AWOL on us.

05:39.276 --> 05:40.569
I ain't gonna run.

05:40.652 --> 05:44.198
Yeah, yeah. I heard
that one before. A lot of times.

05:44.281 --> 05:46.283
Be hearing from me tomorrow.

05:51.830 --> 05:55.584
So, cyberpunks. Those were
the kind of peeps you roll with.

05:57.628 --> 05:58.629
Mm-hm.

05:59.838 --> 06:01.632
-Could've said some--
-Like what?

06:01.715 --> 06:04.218
Seems like a plan from the start.

06:04.301 --> 06:07.096
Maine wouldn't shut up about
this priced Sandy going missing

06:07.179 --> 06:10.015
and I saw you using
an exact same one in this train.

06:10.099 --> 06:13.060
Knew for sure you had his
after the visit to your reaper.

06:13.143 --> 06:16.105
Then thought you'd bat your eyes
at me till they showed.

06:16.939 --> 06:18.690
You're lying the whole time.

06:18.774 --> 06:20.526
Just go home already.

06:21.151 --> 06:22.194
Yeah.

06:27.699 --> 06:28.575
About your mom…

06:29.243 --> 06:30.828
Sorry for your loss.

07:00.315 --> 07:01.692
Mr. Martinez,

07:01.775 --> 07:06.488
wonderful news. Based on your
exemplary academic performance,

07:06.572 --> 07:09.491
the Arasaka Corporation
has awarded you a scholarship

07:09.575 --> 07:12.619
so that you may return to your studies.

07:12.703 --> 07:16.748
This is an exceptionally rare opportunity

07:16.832 --> 07:19.251
and a great honor. Congratulations.

07:19.334 --> 07:20.711
However,

07:20.794 --> 07:23.589
there is still the matter
of your recent violent behavior

07:23.672 --> 07:26.717
regarding Mr. Tanaka on Academy grounds.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.886
Now, I spoke with Mr. Tanaka

07:28.969 --> 07:31.597
and he has graciously agreed

07:31.680 --> 07:34.475
to strike several demerits
from your permanent record

07:34.558 --> 07:36.685
should you offer an apology.

07:36.768 --> 07:38.437
For details, please--

07:41.857 --> 07:42.900
Hmm?

07:42.983 --> 07:44.776
Kid, you're up.

07:54.995 --> 07:57.331
Hey! Over here, kid.

08:00.626 --> 08:02.336
Morning, sunshine. You ready?

08:02.419 --> 08:04.713
The data wasn't lying.
He is just a kid.

08:04.796 --> 08:06.924
-Can he keep up?
-Guess we'll see.

08:07.007 --> 08:09.843
Now I know.
I know he's a sweet little thing,

08:09.927 --> 08:11.970
but keep those grabbing myths to yourself.

08:12.054 --> 08:14.598
Why do we even put up with you?

08:15.265 --> 08:19.144
This one here is Kiwi.
And Dorio and Pilar, you've met.

08:19.228 --> 08:20.562
Make yourself comfy.

08:21.897 --> 08:23.690
-My name is David--
-Too fast.

08:23.774 --> 08:26.026
Let's get right down to biz, kid.

08:26.568 --> 08:27.903
Slot the shard.

08:33.200 --> 08:36.328
Say hello to Arasaka Corporation's
driver and bodyguard…

08:36.411 --> 08:38.038
-Maxim.
-Yeah!

08:38.121 --> 08:41.667
We're gonna swipe the nav data
from the limo he rolls around the area.

08:41.750 --> 08:44.211
Just the data? Not the car?

08:44.294 --> 08:45.379
We clap the ride

08:45.462 --> 08:48.298
and Arasaka's ninjas
will swarm us like flies to shit.

08:48.382 --> 08:50.509
So, yeah, just the data.

08:50.592 --> 08:51.718
How?

08:51.802 --> 08:55.222
Betting on fights
is this lad here's sole joy in life.

08:55.305 --> 08:57.766
He's in one of those seats every weekend.

08:59.059 --> 09:01.603
He always put a bag
stack on Butcher,

09:01.687 --> 09:04.189
bank them on its cold,
splitting, upper cutters.

09:06.316 --> 09:09.611
From hearing alone,
most peeps show up just to see her

09:09.695 --> 09:12.781
paint the cage red
with some poor gut's blood.

09:13.615 --> 09:14.616
Except…

09:20.038 --> 09:22.708
this weekend,
ain't gonna go down like that,

09:22.791 --> 09:27.337
the Butcher's getting butchered
in round one, like a sad sack of meat.

09:34.428 --> 09:35.721
What makes you so sure?

09:35.804 --> 09:38.223
Just trust me on that.

09:41.935 --> 09:43.145
Anyway,

09:43.228 --> 09:46.356
he had a habit of drowning the sorrows
at this one hole in a wall dive.

09:46.440 --> 09:50.861
And that's where you make your move,
few drinks in when he's getting greased.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.661
You nab the key and hand it to Dorio.

10:00.203 --> 10:02.497
She'll photocopy the pop block.

10:02.581 --> 10:07.169
Then we clap the nav data while
sack-of-muscle Max was still shit-faced.

10:08.337 --> 10:09.963
But leave that to us,

10:10.047 --> 10:13.175
you just got to slip the key back
in the slot before he catches on.

10:13.842 --> 10:15.844
That's it. Simple.

10:17.095 --> 10:17.971
Hold on…

10:18.055 --> 10:19.848
His master's calling.

10:19.931 --> 10:24.269
Sheesh, bastard can't catch
a break. No rest for the wicked.

10:24.353 --> 10:25.687
Not good.

10:25.771 --> 10:28.273
-His boss needs him there.
-Shit, on his day off?

10:28.357 --> 10:29.775
Data's not copied yet!

10:29.858 --> 10:32.486
Fuck! Change of plans, kid.

10:32.569 --> 10:34.404
Key to the car. Grab it.

10:35.072 --> 10:37.157
Becca, trip him up.

10:37.240 --> 10:39.451
-Huh?
-Chop chop, go!

10:42.162 --> 10:44.206
-Aah!
-Hey! What the fuck?

10:44.289 --> 10:47.918
-I'm so clumsy. Sorry!
-Watch it, kid! Ooh!

10:49.252 --> 10:52.047
Get in. Nab the data
before he shows.

10:52.881 --> 10:53.882
How in the hell?

10:53.965 --> 10:55.801
I'll handle that.

10:56.426 --> 10:57.302
You get in.

11:00.097 --> 11:02.307
Ahh…

11:05.560 --> 11:07.771
Man…

11:08.522 --> 11:09.439
You good?

11:09.523 --> 11:10.691
Don't talk. Focusing.

11:11.441 --> 11:14.695
Arasaka eyes was such
a huge pain in the ass.

11:15.529 --> 11:17.155
Sorry about that, handsome!

11:17.239 --> 11:20.075
Nah. It's no problem, sweetheart.

11:20.158 --> 11:22.119
I'll make it up to you next time. Okay?

11:22.202 --> 11:24.496
Oh?

11:24.579 --> 11:26.623
-You, bitch!
-Why are you yelling at me?

11:26.707 --> 11:28.959
You're so sensitive, you know!

11:29.042 --> 11:30.919
We're blown. Target coming in hot.

11:31.002 --> 11:32.838
-Stats?
-Just a little more.

11:32.921 --> 11:34.256
Time's up. Cut it!

11:34.339 --> 11:36.091
Almost…

11:36.174 --> 11:37.592
Ahh. Done.

11:37.676 --> 11:39.219
It won't open!

11:39.302 --> 11:41.138
The security's back online?

11:41.221 --> 11:43.223
Like I said, time's up.

11:43.306 --> 11:46.184
Open up! Now! You, fuck!

11:46.852 --> 11:49.312
Oh, shit. No way back.

11:49.396 --> 11:50.522
-Start her up.
-What?

11:50.605 --> 11:51.773
Punch it, kid.

11:51.857 --> 11:53.775
I don't know how to drive!

11:53.859 --> 11:55.902
Time to work.

11:55.986 --> 11:58.405
Hey! Hey!

11:58.488 --> 12:00.741
Get out! I said!

12:00.824 --> 12:02.784
-Show me…
-You're dead meat!

12:02.868 --> 12:04.327
…you got what it takes.

12:04.411 --> 12:05.996
You hear me?

12:06.079 --> 12:10.417
I'll make you and your whole family pay!

12:11.585 --> 12:13.712
Hey! Stop! My car!

12:20.177 --> 12:23.597
Wait! I said, wait!

12:26.057 --> 12:28.268
Sure glad them ain't my wheels.

12:28.351 --> 12:31.813
Take it straight to Aldo's.
You hash the GPS?

12:31.897 --> 12:34.316
Can't from inside. Got a jammer up,

12:34.399 --> 12:37.652
but encryption's shaky.
They'll snatch our position soon,

12:37.736 --> 12:39.571
unless we find solid cover.

12:39.654 --> 12:43.366
Then Aldo's it is.
Should be safe there. On our way.

12:43.450 --> 12:45.410
Ah, fuck, communications cutting out.

12:45.494 --> 12:46.536
-Do I pull over?
-No!

12:46.620 --> 12:50.207
Geo stats ping you,
they'll drop a hit squad on your ass.

12:50.290 --> 12:51.500
Drive like hell!

12:52.876 --> 12:54.878
-Summing a route.
-Thank you.

12:56.129 --> 12:59.466
-You think we can make it?
-It's up to you now.

13:01.885 --> 13:04.596
Look at you. You're practically a pro.

13:04.679 --> 13:05.722
You think so?

13:05.806 --> 13:08.141
I mean, maybe if autopilot wasn't on.

13:08.225 --> 13:09.851
Whatever.

13:09.935 --> 13:11.061
We've got company.

13:11.603 --> 13:12.646
Huh?

13:12.729 --> 13:14.856
Tyger Claws?

13:16.233 --> 13:19.528
Maxim must've
provide them with a new ride.

13:19.611 --> 13:22.113
-That fast?
-Best if we don't fuck with corpos.

13:22.197 --> 13:24.407
Make up the advantage down here on bikes.

13:24.491 --> 13:25.909
Get the highway here.

13:27.744 --> 13:29.704
Why are you running?

13:29.788 --> 13:30.872
Come backand fight, cowards!

13:30.956 --> 13:34.668
Where are you going?

13:34.751 --> 13:36.586
Gotta lose these guys.

13:37.170 --> 13:38.672
Shit. Traffic?

13:38.755 --> 13:40.131
Oh, my, my…

13:40.757 --> 13:42.425
Not good.

13:57.274 --> 13:59.192
Uh… Closing in on us.

13:59.276 --> 14:00.694
Slow-ass!

14:02.779 --> 14:05.198
-Put your buckle up!
-Huh?

14:17.335 --> 14:19.546
How dare you do that to my partner!

14:33.226 --> 14:35.604
Don't underestimate me!

15:04.716 --> 15:06.092
Seems shut-tied.

15:06.176 --> 15:07.802
Aldo should be inside.

15:07.886 --> 15:10.639
Well, at least the jammer
is still running stable.

15:12.474 --> 15:13.642
The doors weren't locked?

15:13.725 --> 15:16.269
Then unlocked for a while.

15:16.353 --> 15:18.355
Stay here. I'll scoop it out.

15:30.367 --> 15:32.827
Come on now, don't run away.

15:32.911 --> 15:35.413
Let's play a little more!

15:57.727 --> 15:58.770
Die!

16:01.648 --> 16:04.275
Die!

16:39.102 --> 16:40.145
Ew…

16:41.021 --> 16:44.399
Ugh!

16:46.443 --> 16:47.652
Sorry for the wait.

16:56.244 --> 16:58.163
Yee-ha!

16:58.246 --> 17:01.916
Yeah!

17:02.500 --> 17:05.628
Well, gotta say not bad for wookie-wookie.

17:05.712 --> 17:07.130
So, we're cool now?

17:07.213 --> 17:09.340
Sure. Welcome to the crew.

17:11.217 --> 17:12.552
But remember, little man.

17:13.219 --> 17:16.556
Ain't no one in this world
you can trust more than yourself.

17:20.143 --> 17:22.604
Start using us as your crutch,
and you're good as dead.

17:22.687 --> 17:23.897
Mm-hm.

17:23.980 --> 17:25.148
Yeah, got you.

17:27.901 --> 17:33.198
Yee-ha!

17:33.281 --> 17:36.201
Check out the precision, dudes!
Fastest thing, isn't it?

17:36.284 --> 17:38.828
I know the only thing that hurts
fastest in the west.

17:41.831 --> 17:43.833
Spit it! Devoted, you say?

17:45.418 --> 17:48.630
All hands on me!
You wanna take up for a test drive?

17:50.882 --> 17:51.925
Thanks.

17:54.302 --> 17:57.305
Immunoblockers.
Enough to get you through a month.

17:57.847 --> 17:59.474
And…

17:59.557 --> 18:01.267
Here's your cut.

18:01.351 --> 18:02.602
Holy shit!

18:02.685 --> 18:06.106
Everybody gets a fair shake.
Only where I operate.

18:07.899 --> 18:09.984
-You still mostly organic?
-Huh?

18:10.068 --> 18:13.321
Save some heads,
then look in to open your cyberware.

18:13.404 --> 18:16.866
Mere bone can't keep page
with the Sandevistan for long.

18:16.950 --> 18:18.201
You've got a point.

18:18.284 --> 18:22.664
Little more chrome and you could've zeroed
that Tyger Claw no prop,

18:22.747 --> 18:24.624
or any goon out there.

18:27.836 --> 18:32.382
It ain't waste of 'ennies if it makes you
stronger. That applies to your cyberware.

18:32.465 --> 18:33.633
And also,

18:33.716 --> 18:34.968
to your crew.

18:35.051 --> 18:37.303
Yeah, alright.

18:37.387 --> 18:41.641
Oh.

18:49.858 --> 18:50.942
Shit…

18:57.866 --> 19:01.911
I believe I was clear when I requested
only the navigation data,

19:01.995 --> 19:04.455
not Arasaka's corporate property.

19:04.539 --> 19:06.624
You got what you
asked for, didn't you?

19:06.708 --> 19:10.211
What I asked for above all else
was your discretion in the matter.

19:10.295 --> 19:12.964
We tried, but you know
how things be sometimes.

19:13.047 --> 19:14.465
Gotta improvise.

19:14.549 --> 19:18.261
It was imperative I learned
Tanaka's routines the places he frequents.

19:18.344 --> 19:21.556
So check the navigation data.
It's all there.

19:21.639 --> 19:25.768
Your joyride put us back at square one
and Tanaka on high alert.

19:25.852 --> 19:28.104
He's already switch sides.
The data is useless.

19:28.188 --> 19:29.981
Okay, switched and sided for what?

19:30.064 --> 19:31.441
That's not for you to know.

19:31.524 --> 19:35.695
Damn! How the hell we supposed to do the
job right when you leave us in the dark?

19:35.778 --> 19:40.408
The less you know, the less I risk.
Understand this and understand it fast.

19:40.491 --> 19:42.076
I do not pay you to think.

19:42.160 --> 19:44.954
I pay you to check the boxes off my list.

19:45.038 --> 19:47.665
It is my place
to see the larger picture.

19:47.749 --> 19:50.752
It is yours to listen.
You will do what you're told.

19:50.835 --> 19:52.962
That is how our business is done.

19:53.755 --> 19:55.298
Are we clear?

19:58.426 --> 20:01.012
Yeah, we're crystal, dude.

20:01.095 --> 20:05.391
Very good. For now, we'll wait
until he lowers his guard again.

20:05.475 --> 20:06.809
I'll be in touch.

20:06.893 --> 20:09.229
Uh-huh. See you.

20:13.233 --> 20:14.400
Who was that?

20:15.193 --> 20:18.696
Faraday. The middleman
who landed us the gig.

20:18.780 --> 20:21.741
He happens to be a top fixer
around these ports.

20:22.742 --> 20:25.203
Thought you were the big boss
making all the calls.

20:25.286 --> 20:29.832
No, I'm the guy who gets shit done.
And he's the one holding all the 'ennies.

20:29.916 --> 20:33.711
Without him and his crutch,
you ain't nothing in this biz.

20:33.795 --> 20:35.380
It's as simple as that.

20:36.714 --> 20:38.883
Don't think too hard about it.

20:38.967 --> 20:40.927
We're celebrating tonight.

20:41.678 --> 20:42.679
Mm.

20:54.107 --> 20:57.402
Heh-heh-heh!

20:59.487 --> 21:03.491
Hey, baby! What do you say, huh?

21:05.910 --> 21:07.912
-Yo.
-Mm.

21:08.496 --> 21:10.248
Um, sorry, but, who are you?

21:10.331 --> 21:13.835
Remember. Come on,
after all we've bee through?

21:13.918 --> 21:15.253
Hmm.

21:18.381 --> 21:20.300
Oh, right. You were at the bar.

21:20.383 --> 21:22.343
Yeah. You like my performance?

21:22.427 --> 21:24.178
-Uh, sure. Yeah.
-Mm.

21:24.929 --> 21:28.558
I'm Rebecca.
I heard you're joining up on Maine's crew?

21:28.641 --> 21:31.311
Maybe. Is this carbonated?

21:31.394 --> 21:32.812
Cheers!

21:32.895 --> 21:36.065
Be seeing you around, then. Bu-bye!

21:36.149 --> 21:37.567
Yeah. See you.

21:45.450 --> 21:50.163
Mr. Martinez, hello again.
Is this a good time?

21:50.246 --> 21:51.831
It sounds rather rowdy on your end.

21:52.749 --> 21:54.334
Uh, yeah, but it's fine.

21:54.417 --> 21:57.545
I trust you received
the message that I left?

21:57.628 --> 21:59.255
Yeah, I got it.

21:59.339 --> 22:01.799
Excellent. Now, about your apology to--

22:01.883 --> 22:04.218
Pass this along
to Katsuo for me, would you?

22:04.302 --> 22:06.095
Er, perhaps it's best if you would--

22:06.179 --> 22:09.349
If he wants revenge,
tell that prick I'll be waiting.

22:09.432 --> 22:10.850
But I'm done going easy.

22:10.933 --> 22:12.518
Oh, and you can all kiss my ass!
